=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but clear environments with a focus on readability in gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lower resolutions are supported, but the visuals are optimized for 1080p.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comfort &amp; controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard and controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable audio and gameplay options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick restarts, so you can jump right back in after a death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note on graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly all in-game elements were handcrafted or built using purchased asset packs. Two of the three boss designs are based on AI-generated concept art, which was then manually edited and integrated. Tiles, player characters, environments, and effects were manually placed and fine-tuned.</p>",
